<html lang='en' style='margin:0;padding:0;'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Celebrating 2000+ Users - KickerGPT Milestone</title>
    <style>
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          margin: 0 !important;
          border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;"
  >
    <table
      role='presentation'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      width='100%'
      style='background:#f5f7fb;padding:32px 0;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center'>
          <table
            role='presentation'
            class='email-container'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            width='640'
            style='width:640px;max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;'
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;'
              >
                <div
                  style='font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111827;'
                >
                  KickerGPT
                </div>
                <div
                  style='margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;'
                >
                  Football intelligence
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:28px 32px 18px;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;'
              >
                <p style='margin:0 0 12px;'>Hey {{name}},</p>
                <p style='margin:0 0 16px;'>
                  We have some exciting news to share with you!
                </p>

                <div style='margin:20px 0;'>
                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-size:32px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;'
                    >🎉 2000+ Users!</div>
                    <div style='font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;'>
                      Over the weekend, we hit an incredible milestone -
                      <strong>2000+ users</strong>
                      are now using KickerGPT! This wouldn't have been possible
                      without amazing users like you.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #10b981;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >🎁 5 Free Prompts - On Us!</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      To celebrate this milestone, we're giving
                      <strong>5 free prompts</strong>
                      to every user. They've already been added to your account
                      - no action needed! Just log in and start using them.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >📱 Google Play Store Launch</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      We're thrilled to announce that
                      <strong>KickerGPT will be available on the Google Play
                        Store soon!</strong> We'll let you know when it's available.
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    style='margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#fef3c7;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;'
                  >
                    <div
                      style='font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;'
                    >🎁 Surprise for Early Downloaders</div>
                    <div style='color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                      Be among the
                      <strong>first 20 people</strong>
                      to download from the Google Play Store and get a special
                      surprise!
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div
                  style='margin:24px 0;padding:18px;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;text-align:center;'
                >
                  <div style='color:#1e40af;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>
                    Follow us on
                    <strong>X (Twitter)</strong>
                    for more updates
                  </div>
                  <a
                    href='https://twitter.com/kickergpt'
                    target='_blank'
                    rel='noopener'
                    style='display:inline-block;padding:10px 24px;background:#000000;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;'
                  >
                    @kickergpt
                  </a>
                </div>

                <p style='margin:20px 0 6px;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;'>
                  Thanks for being part of the KickerGPT community!
                </p>
                <p style='margin:0;font-weight:600;'>The KickerGPT Team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;'
              >
                <p style='margin:0 0 8px;'>
                  You're receiving this email because you requested access to
                  KickerGPT.
                </p>
                <p style='margin:0 0 12px;'>
                  Need help? Reply to this email and we'll get back ASAP.
                </p>
                <a
                  href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'
                  style='color:#4b5563;text-decoration:underline;'
                  target='_blank'
                  rel='noopener'
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>